        "MAIN_GOAL =\"\"\"Insurance companies receive a large number of customer emails reporting incidents such as\n",
        "vehicle accidents, property damage, medical expenses and other insurance-related claims.\n",
        "These emails are often unstructured. Customers may leave out important information,\n",
        "provide unclear details. Manually reading these emails, identifying missing information,\n",
        "verifying claims against policy conditions and responding to customers can be\n",
        "time-consuming.\n",
        "The objective of this project is to build an AI assisted Insurance Claims Processing\n",
        "System that can understand customer claim emails, extract important information, identify\n",
        "missing details, classify claims into Home, Vehicle, Medical or Life Insurance, and verify\n",
        "them against predefined insurance policy rules.\n",
        "The system should also calculate the potential claim amount based on applicable coverage\n",
        "limits and deductibles.\n",
        "The system should support the following outcomes:\n",
        "Approved: The claim satisfies the applicable policy conditions. The system calculates the\n",
        "potential payout and communicates the approval to the customer.\n",
        "Rejected: The claim does not satisfy the applicable policy conditions or falls under a policy\n",
        "exclusion. The system communicates the reason for rejection to the customer.\n",
        "Pending: Required information or supporting documents are missing or unclear. The system\n",
        "generates a follow-up email requesting the necessary information from the customer.\n",
        "The goal is to automate the insurance claims processing workflow, from receiving the initial\n",
        "customer email to assessing the claim and communicating the outcome.\"\"\"\n"
      ]
