        "Loss Details: Ruined engineered oak flooring, water damage to sofa and electronic media console.\n",
        "Category: Home\n",
        "\n",
        "Example 2:\n",
        "Claim:\n",
        "Event Description: Rear-ended at a red light by a commercial truck; trunk crumpled and rear axle bent.\n",
        "Loss Details: Complete rear bumper replacement, quarter panel repair, towing charges.\n",
        "Category: Vehicle\n",
        "\n",
        "Example 3:\n",
        "Claim:\n",
        "Event Description: Emergency appendectomy performed at City Hospital with a 3-day inpatient stay.\n",
        "Loss Details: Surgeon fees, ICU charges, discharge medications, routine blood panels.\n",
        "Category: Medical\n",
        "\n",
        "Example 4:\n",
        "Claim:\n",
        "Event Description: Policyholder passed away due to cardiac arrest; beneficiary filed claim for base sum assured.\n",
        "Loss Details: Death certificate submitted, legal heir certificate attached.\n",
        "Category: Life\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "Return a valid JSON object strictly matching this schema:\n",
        "{{\n",
        "  \"category\": \"<one of: Home, Vehicle, Medical, Life>\",\n",
